Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.20,0:00:02.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello, Kawajiri residence.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:01.81,0:00:04.10,Episode 31 Times,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(381,1)\pos(960,785)}July 16th (Friday) 7:57 AM
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.00,0:00:04.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.91,0:00:06.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, you have the wrong number.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.32,0:00:09.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Superb work, Hayato.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.76,0:00:13.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've kept that meddlesome Rohan at bay.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.68,0:00:16.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I dare say you're a chip\Nright off the old block.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.46,0:00:18.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Like I said, you've got the wrong number.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.78,0:00:19.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.70,0:00:22.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm proud of you, boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.12,0:00:25.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now I have even more reason to\Nprovide for my beautiful family.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.74,0:00:27.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But first, the adults need to talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.00,0:00:33.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Honey Bunch, I'd love a\Ngoodbye kiss before I leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.68,0:00:49.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you doing, Hayato?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.62,0:00:51.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's my expensive china!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.16,0:00:53.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why would you do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.38,0:00:54.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's wrong with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.42,0:00:57.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I never know what's going on\Ninside that head of yours!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.26,0:01:00.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You act like you don't hear\Nme, and I don't know why!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.26,0:01:02.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where did I go wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.00,0:01:13.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't see it yet, Mom,\Nbut he's a murderous psycho.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.90,0:01:15.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I tell anyone about him,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.84,0:01:19.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the listener will explode and\Ntime will reset to this morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.50,0:01:21.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It may not happen for a while,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.38,0:01:24.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but if we keep letting him\Nhave free reign over our lives,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.28,0:01:25.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,eventually he'll kill us.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.50,0:01:46.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But luckily for me, I now know about someone\Nelse who has special powers like Kira!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.94,0:01:47.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rohan Kishibe!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.10,0:01:50.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to find a way\Nto talk to him somehow!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.42,0:01:52.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to get him to help me or we don't
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.48,0:01:55.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,stand a ghost of a\Nchance of defeating Kira!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.56,0:02:01.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rohan's already here!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.86,0:02:06.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I approach him directly,\Nhe'll get blown to smithereens.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.50,0:02:09.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then I'll be forced to\Nrelive the same morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.62,0:02:13.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got to tell Rohan the info\Nwithout meeting him face to face.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.68,0:02:15.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's time to change fate.
