Dialogue: 1,0:02:22.28,0:02:26.79,Note,Note,0,0,0,,Note: [WARNING] Do not read any further.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.48,0:02:24.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hang on!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.48,0:02:27.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rohan did this to me when\Nwe met that other morning!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.32,0:02:29.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.10,0:02:35.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I've been keeping out\Nof sight this entire time.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.14,0:02:37.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no way Rohan could have seen me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.00,0:02:42.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Once the wheels of fate are set in\Nmotion, there's no turning them back.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.48,0:02:45.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hayato.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.72,0:02:49.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hayato.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.76,0:03:08.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Breakdown, Breakdown Breakdown, Breakdown
