Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.58,0:04:11.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Breakdown!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.49,0:04:12.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 1,0:04:11.81,0:04:16.94,Title Part 4,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(648,513)\pos(141,890)\fs60}Episode 36: {\fs80} Another One Bites the Dust, Part 2
Dialogue: 1,0:04:11.81,0:04:16.94,Title Part 4,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(648,513)\pos(141,890)\fs60}Episode 36: {\fs80} Another One Bites the Dust Part 2
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.41,0:04:15.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The weather report never\Nsaid anything about rain!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.42,0:04:21.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sure you would like\Nto believe you shattered
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.80,0:04:24.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,your mother's favorite\Nteapot of your own free will.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.68,0:04:25.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But you'd be wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.18,0:04:31.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You simply experienced a reoccurrence of\Nthe pot breaking from the previous morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.72,0:04:33.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's preordained, son.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.48,0:04:37.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's how fate works,\Nas you're about to learn.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.18,0:04:42.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If Rohan transformed you into a book the\Nmorning before, then a book you shall be.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.50,0:04:45.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That is what makes Deadly Queen's\NBites the Dust unstoppable.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.84,0:04:49.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It reverses time and nullifies\Nthe exposure of my identity.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.84,0:04:54.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Which means I'll have the\Npleasure of watching Rohan
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.40,0:04:58.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,explode into obsolescence and\Nstill make it to work on time.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:59.32,0:05:02.90,Note,Note,0,0,0,,Note: It rained. → At 8:27 AM, lightning struck above the Pepsi sign.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.36,0:05:01.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.27,0:05:02.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't let Rohan die!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.72,0:05:06.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to go save him\Nbefore it's too late!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.76,0:05:24.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Poor Rohan Kishibe.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.64,0:05:28.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now watch carefully.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.46,0:05:32.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The fool has absolutely no idea\Nwhy he's about to breathe his last.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.32,0:05:37.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I'm sure he's realized that his life\Nas a manga artist has come to an end.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.90,0:05:47.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Eichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.70,0:06:00.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, not Rohan!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.42,0:06:06.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh God, why?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.36,0:06:13.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hi, Ito.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.42,0:06:16.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your visit with Rohan is\Nnow as if it never happened,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.46,0:06:19.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and the morning will go\Non as it always would.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.54,0:06:22.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course, I could undo\NBites the Dust right now,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.76,0:06:26.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,which means that Rohan's death would\Nbecome a permanent temporal point.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.20,0:06:28.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But for now, I think\NI'll let it do its thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.70,0:06:32.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I suspect a few of his cohorts\Nwill be dropping by shortly.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.86,0:06:37.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When they do you're going to make me a\Nproud papa by exterminating the lot of them?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.26,0:06:39.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're my own personal landmine!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.44,0:06:42.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But chin up
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.64,0:06:45.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,as long as you're a good little\Nsecret weapon bites the dust
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.50,0:06:49.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,won't harm you So relax and\Ndo whatever you schoolboys do
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.34,0:06:56.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well daddy's off to the station\Nno slacking at school now!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.46,0:07:03.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is only happening because\Nhe crossed paths with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.84,0:07:05.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's my fault!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.54,0:07:07.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He met me and got murdered for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.30,0:07:20.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What now?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.88,0:07:24.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Isn't there anything I can\Ndo to stop this monster?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.80,0:07:32.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pardon me, can I ask you a question?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.46,0:07:36.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Would you happen to have the time?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.98,0:07:39.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My stupid watch seems\Nto be out of commission.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.36,0:07:42.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello in there, anyone home?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.02,0:07:47.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it's 8.33.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.44,0:07:51.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know, I have this weird\Nfeeling I've seen you before.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.88,0:07:53.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, where was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.56,0:07:56.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You wouldn't happen to\Nknow who I am, would you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.76,0:07:57.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.67,0:07:58.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh well, my mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.54,0:08:02.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope I didn't weird you out or anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.32,0:08:04.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But now I know it's 8.33.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.76,0:08:05.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.76,0:08:07.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mr. Jotaro!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.02,0:08:09.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like it is after 8.30.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.00,0:08:10.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.28,0:08:12.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rohan sensei knew we were coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.88,0:08:13.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where'd he go?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.46,0:08:16.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These are Rohan Kishibe's friends!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.68,0:08:18.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They plan to meet here!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.90,0:08:21.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They must have the same\Nkind of powers as him!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.80,0:08:25.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So I bet they all came here to\Nquestion me about Yoshikage Kira!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.34,0:08:33.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, no, no, no, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.00,0:08:38.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If they figure out I'm Hayato Kawajiri\Nand start interrogating me about Dad,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.08,0:08:39.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it's all over for them!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.06,0:08:45.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry about that, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.42,0:08:48.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was looking for my friends and I'm\Nstill kind of groggy from oversleeping.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.44,0:08:50.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know I've seen this kid's face before,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.42,0:08:53.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but for the life of me,\NI can't remember where.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.22,0:08:55.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, look!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.18,0:08:56.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's Josuke and Okuyasu!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.98,0:08:57.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's up, bro?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.89,0:08:58.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yo, Koichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.81,0:09:00.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hope your morning's been spiffy, Jotaro!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.06,0:09:02.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Th-there are two more of them!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.82,0:09:06.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kira told me that others would\Neventually be showing up!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.88,0:09:08.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He was talking about them!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.76,0:09:11.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,...the kid's house without\NRohan helping us out.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.04,0:09:15.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry, I nearly forgot I was\Nstill hanging on to this.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.36,0:09:16.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I believe this is yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.10,0:09:20.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, thanks a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.16,0:09:23.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know, it might be the angle.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.58,0:09:25.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah, I'm sure of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.40,0:09:27.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know I've seen that face before.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.80,0:09:31.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know from where, but he\Nlooks too familiar to be a stranger.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.64,0:09:35.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Koichi, look at the name\Non his backpack. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.38,0:09:38.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hi, it's Okawajiri! What?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.08,0:09:41.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Crap, they figured me out!
