Dialogue: 1,0:09:50.06,0:09:51.48,Episode 31 Times,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(1,393)\pos(960,785)}July 16th (Friday) 8:34 AM
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.62,0:09:57.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hayato Kawajiri, what the\Nhell are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.08,0:09:59.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Was all this planned?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.96,0:10:03.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, could this have something\Nto do with Rohan-sensei?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.18,0:10:05.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What am I supposed to do now?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.14,0:10:09.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If these guys start questioning\Nme about my dad, it's all over!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.42,0:10:11.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The bomb will kill every one of them!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.84,0:10:16.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, please don't ask me any questions!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.96,0:10:21.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you guys end up getting killed,\Nwho's gonna get rid of the murderer?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.06,0:10:24.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I have to dupe them, then so be it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.56,0:10:26.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whatever it takes, I can't let them die.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.80,0:10:32.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd like to ask you about this photo.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.06,0:10:36.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To be more precise, I want to know the\Nreason behind your video recording.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.02,0:10:38.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Be straight with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.66,0:10:41.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why were you... Shoot! Nosebleed!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.74,0:10:42.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh no!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.65,0:10:44.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know why my nose\Nstarted bleeding out of nowhere,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.00,0:10:46.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I have to find a doctor, sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.84,0:10:47.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold it!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.28,0:10:50.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You said you got a nosebleed, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.26,0:10:51.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.04,0:10:55.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, let me see.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.72,0:10:58.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.70,0:10:59.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I need a doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.30,0:11:02.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nah, I don't think it's that bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.34,0:11:05.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.25,0:11:06.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not even bleeding.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.32,0:11:13.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Josuke Higashikata, nice to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.54,0:11:14.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's Jotaro Kujo.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.00,0:11:16.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,one of my relatives.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.46,0:11:18.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Derp face over there is Okuyasu Nijimura.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.22,0:11:22.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And that's Koichi Hirosei,\Nthe nicest guy I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.42,0:11:26.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You go to Budogaoka Elementary, so\Nyou've got some time before class starts.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.00,0:11:29.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We won't take up much of your time.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.56,0:11:30.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, about this picture.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.08,0:11:34.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If it's nothing, we'll just be on our way.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.02,0:11:38.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It is something, but I can't\Nanswer any of your questions.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.18,0:11:40.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please don't ask.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.82,0:11:42.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You see the man you're filming?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.20,0:11:44.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Would he happen to be your dad?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.98,0:11:45.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm begging you!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.89,0:11:47.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't say anything else!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.08,0:11:52.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.99,0:11:53.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What have I done?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.06,0:11:56.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now they're going to\Nask even more questions.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.02,0:12:00.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you mean, don't say anything else?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.42,0:12:01.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're not gonna stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.52,0:12:03.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just what is it that we shouldn't say?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.32,0:12:04.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's nothing I can do!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.82,0:12:06.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Does all of this have to do with your dad?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.66,0:12:08.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The bomb's gonna go off!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.16,0:12:09.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's gonna kill them all!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.08,0:12:12.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell's going on, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.06,0:12:14.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why can't we say anything else?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.00,0:12:17.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I mean, we haven't\Neven asked him anything yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.56,0:12:18.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Given his reaction,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.00,0:12:23.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it seems the mere act of us questioning\Nthe kid is what's sending him into a panic.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.16,0:12:24.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.58,0:12:30.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have no other choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.50,0:12:33.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I die here, they'll\Nstill be able to live.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.08,0:12:36.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm the bomb, so I have to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.48,0:12:38.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With me out of the picture,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.02,0:12:43.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know these guys will figure out a\Nway to defeat that devil and save Mom!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.58,0:12:47.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It shouldn't be this difficult.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.78,0:12:50.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's just ask him about\NKosaku Kawajiri already.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.20,0:12:52.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold on, Josuke.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.60,0:12:54.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Something is up with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.66,0:12:58.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, what's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.00,0:12:59.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.82,0:13:04.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.74,0:13:05.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.84,0:13:08.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Something's keeping me\Nfrom slashing my throat.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.24,0:13:11.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, what isn't that Kira's? Yeah. It is.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.84,0:13:13.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's a face I'd never forget.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.36,0:13:14.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's deadly queen.
