Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.42,0:13:22.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Actually, you're looking at\Ndeadly Queen's bomb type 3.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.62,0:13:25.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bites the dust to attack me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.36,0:13:26.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now would be futile.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.56,0:13:31.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In fact, the only reason you can see me is\Nbecause I've already entered your pupils.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.08,0:13:34.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It doesn't matter how\Nmany of you have gathered.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.10,0:13:35.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,together.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.01,0:13:39.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The moment you asked about my true\Nidentity, your fate was sealed.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.26,0:13:57.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, Hiato.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.56,0:13:59.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess you're already awake.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.08,0:14:01.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm glad you finally decided to answer me,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.46,0:14:04.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but there's no need to scream\Nthis early in the morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.60,0:14:05.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Breakfast is ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.76,0:14:06.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come and get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.18,0:14:15.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I tried, but I couldn't stop him.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.34,0:14:17.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He got them too.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.58,0:14:20.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It doesn't matter what I do now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.96,0:14:21.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In one hour,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.00,0:14:24.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,fate will run its course and Rohan and his
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.10,0:14:26.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,friends will be wiped out\Nthe face of the earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.20,0:14:27.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.11,0:14:28.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's all my fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.34,0:14:30.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't even kill myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.12,0:14:32.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, if I died,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.10,0:14:34.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,he wouldn't be able to use his power,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.16,0:14:36.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but Bites the Dust is\Nprogrammed to protect me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.80,0:14:39.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's unstoppable!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.84,0:14:41.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yoshikage Kira is a monster!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.80,0:14:47.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Unless he dies or decides to shut off\NBites the Dust at just the right time,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.42,0:14:49.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,those guys are going to be blown sky high!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.92,0:14:51.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's made sure of it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.10,0:15:12.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He either has to die or shut off bites\Nthe dust at just the right moment
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.64,0:15:17.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's crazy I never thought\NI'd ever be capable
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.08,0:15:19.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,of something like killing\Na person in cold blood
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.18,0:15:25.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, I'm a puny 11-year-old kid What\Ncould I do against a monster like him?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.72,0:15:28.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A monster
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.68,0:15:30.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's it?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.70,0:15:35.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Eleven years old or not, there's one\Nthing I can use to take him down for good.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.98,0:15:39.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kira called me his secret weapon earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.84,0:15:44.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I've got my own weapon, and it's\Nslumbering in the shadows of the attic.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.58,0:15:47.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've never prayed before,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.34,0:15:51.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but if there's a god out there, I\Nneed you to come through for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.78,0:15:56.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, God, help me find the strength\Nto kill this homicidal maniac.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.14,0:16:12.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So I was right the sun makes this\Ncat plant spring to life then it
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.94,0:16:17.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,attacks its target by shooting bullets\Nof compressed air it's incredible it
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.08,0:16:21.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,can generate so much power with such\Nlittle light awesome I'll use its
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.80,0:16:25.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,killer instinct to send an air bullet\Nflying kira's way at point-blank
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.90,0:16:29.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,range.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.81,0:16:33.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have a plan, but when and\Nhow should I execute it?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.28,0:16:35.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mom's here, so I can't do it
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.62,0:16:40.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,inside or nearby.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.82,0:16:42.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah, my hat!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.46,0:16:44.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When I leave, he'll put it on my head!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.32,0:16:45.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That'll be my chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.78,0:16:49.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He'll come up right behind me,\Nright in the point-blank range.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.64,0:16:51.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's when Then I'll get him!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.36,0:16:54.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're kidding!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.46,0:16:56.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why didn't you say we were on the air?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.82,0:17:02.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm pretty sure Dad said he\Nwanted another cup of coffee.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.30,0:17:09.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kawajiri residence?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.34,0:17:11.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, wrong number.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.30,0:17:14.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This isn't the Sakurai residence.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.46,0:17:25.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sweetie, I have something special for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.94,0:17:26.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come drink.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.22,0:17:29.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a piping hot cup of fresh coffee.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.28,0:17:37.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, what the hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.46,0:17:39.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's such a pleasant morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.22,0:17:43.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I suppose one more cup before I leave\Nfor work wouldn't hurt anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.22,0:17:46.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everything is set in stone under\NBite the Dust's power, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.32,0:17:50.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Once something is broken,\Nit's destined to break again.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.32,0:17:52.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And there's not a damn thing I can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.80,0:17:54.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You said it yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.78,0:17:59.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh no!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.82,0:18:01.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My favorite China tea set!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.72,0:18:03.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take that, ass!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.84,0:18:06.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alright, Mom, see you later!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.46,0:18:07.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm off to school now!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.08,0:18:12.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's nothing to worry about.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.78,0:18:14.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll never let anyone hurt you, Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.78,0:18:15.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Trust me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.46,0:18:29.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where did that come from?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.06,0:18:31.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's always so aloof.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.36,0:18:33.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I never know what's going on in his head.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.68,0:18:38.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But then, we have mornings like this\None, and I can't help but love him.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.32,0:18:41.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let me, I'll have this\Ncleaned up in a jiff.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.56,0:18:44.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No use crying over spilled coffee.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.76,0:18:48.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I hope it didn't burn\Nyou too badly. It's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.86,0:18:49.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.66,0:18:58.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's still not here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.60,0:19:01.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.82,0:19:03.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why hasn't he shown up yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.08,0:19:07.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.26,0:19:08.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He was already here last time.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.94,0:19:10.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's the hold up?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.24,0:19:11.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.48,0:19:12.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The weather report.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.46,0:19:13.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Never said anything about rain.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.84,0:19:15.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's already beginning to rain.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.66,0:19:19.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wonder if I accidentally changed\Ndestiny by leaving the house.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.52,0:19:20.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,before he did.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.88,0:19:22.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, that's impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.76,0:19:25.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If he's gonna try and sneak\Nup to put the hat on my head,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.74,0:19:27.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,there's no question\Nhe'll try approaching me?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.44,0:19:28.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,from behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.06,0:19:31.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Time is running out!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.34,0:19:33.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lightning struck the Pepsi sign!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.28,0:19:35.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've gotta calm down. I've still got
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.08,0:19:36.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,two minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.99,0:19:41.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I have more than two minutes before\NRohan Kishibe spontaneously explodes.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.44,0:19:42.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just have to believe.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.96,0:19:50.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's hiding in the shadow of the tree!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.20,0:19:51.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's been here all along!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.90,0:19:53.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How could I have missed that?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.70,0:19:55.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Under any other circumstance,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.00,0:19:59.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd say this morning was pleasant,\Nbut Hayato wasn't himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.80,0:20:00.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why, though?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.92,0:20:02.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm getting a very strange feeling.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.14,0:20:07.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It feels like we've relived this\Nmorning several times now. Maybe three.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.94,0:20:10.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, wait, at least four times. Oh no!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.96,0:20:12.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Does he sense that something's not right?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.86,0:20:14.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It doesn't matter, there's no time!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.18,0:20:18.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have no other choice but\Nto blast him from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.20,0:20:22.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Could he have figured out that I'm gonna
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.04,0:20:25.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,use the cat plan as a\Nweapon to take him out?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.16,0:20:27.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that why he's deciding\Nto keep his distance
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.46,0:20:31.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,no way if he knew he\Nwouldn't be that close? Okay,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.52,0:20:33.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm only gonna get one\Nshot to finish him off So I
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.88,0:20:37.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,have to make it count if I\Nmiss Rohan will explode his
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.88,0:20:40.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,friends will be obliterated\Nand that murderer will
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.36,0:20:43.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,deactivate bites the dust\Nmaking the whole thing permanent
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.68,0:20:46.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If that happens, he ends up the victor.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.50,0:20:47.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's now or never.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.28,0:20:50.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just take one more step to the left.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.76,0:20:52.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hurry up and step out\Nfrom the shadow of that
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.72,0:20:55.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,shitty tree so I can\Nblow you to kingdom come!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.80,0:20:59.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.24,0:21:00.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He hit himself even more!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.26,0:21:06.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The look in Hayato's eyes this morning\Nradiated a tenacity I've never seen in him.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.52,0:21:08.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was almost the exact\Nsame look those Lao
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.88,0:21:11.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tzu Koichi heroes saying Josuke gave off.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.02,0:21:16.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know what it is, but something's\Ntelling me I need to watch his every move.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.28,0:21:21.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then again, as it stands, Hayato's\Ncompletely helpless. Shit! I'm screwed!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.02,0:21:26.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A few seconds past 8.29, and the bomb\Nwill start ripping Rohan Kishibe apart!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.10,0:21:31.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.92,0:21:33.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The brat is panic-stricken.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.94,0:21:37.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's like a desperate rat toiling\Nand drowning in a cesspool of filth.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.94,0:21:40.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess I was imagining his tenacity.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.20,0:21:42.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those are the eyes of defeat.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.18,0:21:45.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He came out!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.98,0:21:50.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You left home without your hat,\Nso I thought I'd bring it to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.56,0:21:55.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you're listening up\Nthere, thank you, God.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.72,0:21:57.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks for working your\Nmagic and making that
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.52,0:22:00.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,murderer leave the safety\Nof that tree's shadow.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.16,0:22:01.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm ready to do this!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.56,0:22:04.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now die, Yoshikage Kira!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.90,0:22:13.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.30,0:22:16.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.96,0:22:20.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A clean shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.52,0:22:21.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.36,0:22:24.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He still hasn't shown up yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.06,0:22:28.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Perhaps he took a different\Nroute to school and I missed him.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.72,0:22:34.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Prepare to die, murderer!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.20,0:22:42.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.70,0:22:45.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know as of late...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.34,0:22:46.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.58,0:22:49.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My nails have shown unprecedented growth,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.48,0:22:54.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,which got me thinking about how lately my\Nlife has been devoid of all that is good.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.86,0:22:57.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But the contents of this\Npocket confirm my feeling
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.00,0:23:01.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that a guardian angel has\Nreturned to watch over me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.58,0:23:07.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Remember when I broke Mom's special\Nteacup this morning at breakfast?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.82,0:23:10.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The coffee spilled on my\Nwrist, giving me a nasty burn.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.84,0:23:15.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So I took off the watch and placed\Nit safe and sound in my chest pocket.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.44,0:23:17.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And lo and behold, it\Nwas the right choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.24,0:23:21.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Had I not spilled that fateful\Ncup of coffee, where would I be?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.18,0:23:23.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How's this possible?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.76,0:23:26.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Things were supposed\Nto work out this time!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.78,0:23:28.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, I messed up again!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.74,0:23:33.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And in a few seconds,\Neverything's gonna go to shit!
